<title>CROATIA: Croatian Feb real wage index 104.9 vs 108.8 in Jan.</title>
<headline>Croatian Feb real wage index 104.9 vs 108.8 in Jan.</headline>
<dateline>ZAGREB 1997-05-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The State Bureau of Statistics issued the following economic indicator details.</p>
<p> CROATIA NET WAGES		 FEBRUARY   JANUARY    FEB '96</p>
<p> Real wage index (base 1996)    104.9	108.8	 94.5</p>
<p> Nominal wages (HRK)		2,196	2,274	1,908</p>
<p> Public sector			2,329	2,375	2,026</p>
<p> Goods,services sector	    2,147	2,235	1,864</p>
</text>
